{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":236,"name":null,"username":"Cellen","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.moonshot.ai/cellen/{size}/21_2.png","created_at":"2025-11-07T03:27:30.414Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi developer,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re writing to inform you about two important updates to the Kimi API platform: the launch of new models and a significant pricing update for our turbo models.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-236-h-1-new-models-kimi-k2-thinking-and-kimi-k2-thinking-turbo-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-236-h-1-new-models-kimi-k2-thinking-and-kimi-k2-thinking-turbo-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1. New Models: \u003ccode\u003ekimi-k2-thinking\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003ekimi-k2-thinking-turbo\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe have released two new models designed for complex reasoning, multi-step instructions, and agent-like tasks (such as tool use and function calling).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"//forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/original/1X/dabcea5802c101c9404868811c45fd5d4bf1e767.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/vd2PX4jJqLhBKrjFKyrmV4NsCk7.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/dabcea5802c101c9404868811c45fd5d4bf1e767_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"vd2PX4jJqLhBKrjFKyrmV4NsCk7\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"//forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/dabcea5802c101c9404868811c45fd5d4bf1e767_2_690x388.jpeg, //forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/dabcea5802c101c9404868811c45fd5d4bf1e767_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, //forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/dabcea5802c101c9404868811c45fd5d4bf1e767_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2F3540\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1080 249 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can get started with the new models right away with the guide:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Start Guide:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://platform.moonshot.ai/docs/guide/use-kimi-k2-thinking-model\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eUsing Thinking Models - Kimi API Platform\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor full details, you can see the technical blog and our official announcement:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTech Blog:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://moonshotai.github.io/Kimi-K2/thinking.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eKimi K2 Thinking\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnnouncement:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/Kimi_Moonshot/status/1986449512538513505\"\u003ehttps://x.com/Kimi_Moonshot/status/1986449512538513505\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"//forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/original/1X/a1b52078709078d4ee9d514ff2c2bb15a5825eba.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/n4wVYUW6r2qqWHKPJbjIZ3BJGGu.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/a1b52078709078d4ee9d514ff2c2bb15a5825eba_2_690x295.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"n4wVYUW6r2qqWHKPJbjIZ3BJGGu\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"690\" height=\"295\" srcset=\"//forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/a1b52078709078d4ee9d514ff2c2bb15a5825eba_2_690x295.jpeg, //forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/a1b52078709078d4ee9d514ff2c2bb15a5825eba_2_1035x442.jpeg 1.5x, //forum.tos-s3-ap-southeast-1.volces.com/uploads/optimized/1X/a1b52078709078d4ee9d514ff2c2bb15a5825eba_2_1380x590.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E5E5EA\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e4096×1757 331 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince the launch, we’ve been encouraged to see some initial third-party analysis. For instance, in a recent T²-Bench benchmark for agentic tool use, the \u003ccode\u003ekimi-k2-thinking\u003c/code\u003e model was evaluated alongside other models. You can see the full post \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/1986541785511043536\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis early feedback gives us confidence that the models are proving capable in the complex areas they were built for.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-236-h-2-new-pricing-for-turbo-api-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-236-h-2-new-pricing-for-turbo-api-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2. New Pricing for Turbo API\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are significantly reducing the price for the existing \u003ccode\u003ekimi-k2-turbo\u003c/code\u003e model.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur new \u003ccode\u003ekimi-k2-thinking-turbo\u003c/code\u003e model will launch directly with this same new, \u003cstrong\u003elower pricing\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere is the new pricing (effective November 6, 2025) compared to the old one (per 1 million tokens):\u003c/p\u003e\n td {white-space:nowrap;border:0.5pt solid #dee0e3;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:middle;word-break:normal;word-wrap:normal;}\n\u003cdiv class=\"md-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eToken Type\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eOld Price\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eNew Price\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eDiscount\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput (cache hit)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$0.60\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$0.15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e(75% OFF)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput (cache miss)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$2.40\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$1.15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e(50% OFF)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$10.00\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e$8.00\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e(20% OFF)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-236-our-thinking-behind-this-change-the-why-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-236-our-thinking-behind-this-change-the-why-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOur thinking behind this change (The “Why”)\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe want to be direct about why we’re doing this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter observing API usage, we found that \u003cstrong\u003ecoding\u003c/strong\u003e is a primary use case. We also learned two things about this scenario:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is extremely \u003cstrong\u003espeed-sensitive\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is heavily weighted toward \u003cstrong\u003einput tokens\u003c/strong\u003e (e.g., providing large codebases, files, or histories as context).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo, we are making these changes to directly address what we’ve learned from your usage. By drastically cutting input token costs (up to 75% off) and offering high-speed models (up to 100 tokens/second), we aim to make the Kimi API a more practical and affordable tool for the tasks you are actually performing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new \u003ccode\u003ekimi-k2-thinking-turbo\u003c/code\u003e model, as noted, uses this same new, low-cost pricing from launch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new pricing is already active in your dashboard.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-236-feedback-support-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-236-feedback-support-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeedback \u0026amp; Support\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re always here to help and listen to your feedback. Please reach out to us:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e api-service@moonshot.ai\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForum:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://forum.moonshot.ai/\"\u003ehttps://forum.moonshot.ai/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiscord:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://discord.com/invite/TYU2fdJykW\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eKimi\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2025-11-07T03:50:25.580Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":499,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":2491.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":104,"topic_slug":"an-update-on-new-k2-models-and-new-pricing","display_username":null,"primary_group_name":"mis